    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagane lya ng'wa Mulungu kūlī Abulamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyī ū mhayo gwa ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Abulamu mu koolechiwa; ūng'wīla gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Abulamu ūhaya, “Ee SEEBA wa būdūla bose, ūkūninha kī? Īkī ū nene nalīshila alīyo hū natī na ng'wana; hama ū wa kwīyingīla ī kaya yane alīho Elieza muna Damasko!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulamu ongeja kūhaya, “Ūtaalī kūninha baana, na lūūlū ū ng'wingīji wane atūbiza ūngī ūlū atī nsese",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nsese:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū misa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa kūbyalīlwa mu kaya yane!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū mhayo gwa ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla gūlīhaya, “Ū ng'wenūyo atūbiza ng'wingīji wako yaya, ū ng'wingīji wako akūbiza ng'witūnja wako wa kūbyala bebe gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūmfunya hanze ū Abulamu, ūng'wīla gīkī, “Alilolaga ū kwigūlū; jibalage ī sonda ūlū ūdūgije kūjibala.” Ūng'wīla, “Ū būbyīle wako būkūbiza gīko!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulamu ūgūzunya ū mhayo gwa ng'wa SEEBA, nang'hwe ūng'wisaabīla būtūngīlīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla, “Ū nene nalī SEEBA ūyo nakakwīnja mu Ulu, sī ya Bakalidayo, nūkwenha kūūnū gīkī nakwinhe ī sī yenīyī, wīdime ībize yako ya wikomangīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Abulamu ūshosha gīkī, “Alīyo lūūlū SEEBA Mulungu, nakūmana ginehe gīkī ī sī yenīyī īkūbiza yane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Nenhelage ndogoosa ya ng'ombe na mbūli ng'hīma, hamò na ng'ondi; ī jose jibize ja myaka idatū datū, na mhunda, na ng'hune ya ng'hūūlū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wenhela ī shose shenīsho; būlī yene wītandūla ha gatī, gūbiza mapingili abīlī. Hūna a mapingili genayo ūgiheja būlī lyene na lyichalyo. Alīyo ī noni atajitandūlile habīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulamu wikala henaho alīlang'hana, ayūjipeeja ī noni ījo jikalyaga nyama jitizūgwa hoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī līīmi aho līlīsalalīja, kūjīlīīla mu ka munhū ūyo, ū Abulamu ūtindwa tūlo ndito; na giiti shitaale sha kogohya shūngwīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo, ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Managa hape gīkī, a banhū ba būbyīle wako bakūbiza balobeji mu sī ītī yabo, bakwītwa kūbiza basese na kūluhiwa kūshisha ikanza lya myaka magana anè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī lihanga īlo līkūbīīta kūbiza basese lyenīlo, nakūlyinha nsango; hanuma bakūfuma mo balī na sabo ningī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū bebe ng'wene ūkūcha ūjīkwe, ūje kū bakūlūgenji bako mu mhola; mu būnamhala bowiza, bo shikū ningī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba būbyīle wako bakūshoka hangī ū mu sī īyī mu shibyalīlwe sha kanè; nguno ū būbi wa Baamoli būtaalī ū kūshika a ha būkalīkījo wabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyalibīla ī līīmi nī giiti shūkūbanīja, kwimanīla lilonga lya kūbiza gītī lyahulīlo lya moto līkūzuukaga lyochi, na chenge shikūligimaga moto; ī shikolo shenīsho shūbīta a ha gatī ya mabudīka ga mibimba ya mitugo genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ū SEEBA ūbeeja ilagane nū Abulamu, ūhaya gīkī, “Ū būbyīle wako nalīwinha ī sī yenīyī, kwandīja kū mongo gwa Misili kūkaja kū mongo gwa Flati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yoi ī haha īlī sī ya Bakeni, Bakenuji, Bakadimoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahītī, Bapelizi, Balefai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamoli, Bakanaani, Bagiligashi na Bayebusi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
